  exerciseText: Dropping items duplicates them
  hintText: Is it actually dropping items? Dropping logic should spawn the item in
    the world and remove it from the inventory
  solutionText: InventorySystem is not actually removing the item from the list when
    it drops it. Need to remove it from the itemSOList.
